Native controller tests are built with tools/host-native-tests/CMakeLists.txt.
See tools/host-native-tests/README.md for commands and coverage.
UI tests use tools/host-screenshot-offline, exact production LVGL, and stored BMP references.
Hardware-only test boundaries are represented by test/native_stubs/platform;
Arduino-shaped stubs are retained solely for the original test reference libraries.
No firmware build links these stubs or requires PlatformIO.
